         <notesStmt>
            <note type="project" target="dat1">Whitman's note on an earlier draft of this poem (<ref target="uva.00120">uva.00120</ref>) indicates that he sent the poem to the <hi rend="italic">New York Herald</hi> on March 8, 1888, although the emperor of the title, Wilhelm I of Germany, did not die until March 9. This manuscript almost certainly dates to February or March 1888.</note>
            <note type="work_relations" target="xxx.00370" cert="high">"The Dead Emperor" was published in the 10 May 1888 issue of the <hi rend="italic">New York Herald</hi> and was reprinted later that year in <hi rend="italic">November Boughs</hi>.
            </note>                    	
