      <body>
         <pb facs="nyp_bb.00003.jpg" xml:id="leaf001r" type="recto"/>
            <note type="authorial" place="top" hand="#h02">follow copy strictly</note>
            <note type="authorial" place="right" rend="circled" hand="#h01">personal</note>
         <lg type="poem">
            <head type="main" rend="underline">The Dead Emperor.</head>
            <l>Today with bending head and eyes, thou <lb/>too, Columbia,</l>
            <l>Less for the mighty crown laid low in <lb/>sorrow&#8212;less for the Emperor,</l>
            <l>Thy true consolence breathest, sendest <lb/><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">far,</del> <add place="above" seq="2">out,</add></subst> o'er many a salt sea mile,</l>
            <l>Mourning <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the</del> <add place="above" seq="2">a</add></subst> good old man&#8212;<subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the</del> <add place="above" seq="2">a</add></subst> <choice><orig>faith-<lb/>ful</orig><reg>faithful<lb/></reg></choice> shepherd, patriot.</l>
               <signed rend="underline">Walt Whitman</signed>
         </lg>
            <note hand="#h03" rend="underline" type="archival" place="bottom">mqxo</note>
         <pb facs="nyp_bb.00004.jpg" xml:id="leaf001v" type="verso"/>
         <note type="archival" hand="#h04" place="bottom">NYPL</note>
